# Responsibility placement

Before implementation, identify the owner and destination of each new
responsibility. Prefer existing abstractions and repository conventions.

- Keep changes within the approved ticket; explain required adjacent edits.
- Add or update established tests when behavior changes.
- Do not move code solely to reduce file length.
- Avoid unrelated cleanup and premature rewrites.
- Document exceptions when the existing architecture prevents a clean boundary.
- Report uncertainty and actual test evidence; never invent repository facts or
  passing results.
